<Layout title="Express Entry Draws Explained: How Invitations Work & Recent Trends | ImmigrationPoints.com" description="Understand how Canada's Express Entry invitation rounds work, including general draws, category-based selections, recent CRS cutoff trends, and what to expect in 2026.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

